{"id":"141fe1f1e15dc325","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-degree-theory-operations.md","title":"Consistency Skeleton, Meet Theory, and Join Theory","display":"df-degree-theory-operations — Consistency Skeleton, Meet Theory, and Join Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-degree-theory-operations","aliases":["67-df-degree-theory-operations"],"display":"df-degree-theory-operations — Consistency Skeleton, Meet Theory, and Join Theory","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-structure]]","[[67-df-finite-subtheory]]","[[67-df-consistency-statement]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_chapter":"7","source_section":"§1","source_label":"definitions of A^T, A down B, A up B","source_printed_pages":[94],"source_pdf_pages":[105],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-degree-theory-operations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-degree-theory-operations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-degree-theory-operations — Consistency Skeleton, Meet Theory, and Join Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"650dc4b8018183d7\" href=\"?note=650dc4b8018183d7\" title=\"67-df-finite-subtheory\">67-df-finite-subtheory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"definitions of A^T, A down B, A up B"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>94</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>105</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\mathsf{Ext}(T),d_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\mathsf{Ext}(T),d_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\\)</span>，并固定采用原始递归公理集代表。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\upharpoonright k\">\\(A\\upharpoonright k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\upharpoonright k\">\\(B\\upharpoonright k\\)</span> 是按固定编码界截取的有限子理论，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"650dc4b8018183d7\" href=\"?note=650dc4b8018183d7\" title=\"67-df-finite-subtheory\">67-df-finite-subtheory</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}\\)</span> 为有限理论的一致性句，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a>；有限公理集有标准有效证明检查式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 为公理集并集。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_T,M_T,J_T\">\\(H_T,M_T,J_T\\)</span> 的输入域限于上述 PR 代表，均由输入公理集及固定编码有效决定，不选择度的代表元。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_T(A)\\coloneqq T+\\{\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_T(A)\\coloneqq T+\\{\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_T(A,B)\\coloneqq T+\\{\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}\\lor\\mathrm{Con}_{B\\upharpoonright k}:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_T(A,B)\\coloneqq T+\\{\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}\\lor\\mathrm{Con}_{B\\upharpoonright k}:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J_T(A,B)\\coloneqq T+\\{\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{B\\upharpoonright k}:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J_T(A,B)\\coloneqq T+\\{\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{B\\upharpoonright k}:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书第7章§1开头（印刷94页，PDF105页）分别写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^T\">\\(A^T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\downarrow B\">\\(A\\downarrow B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\uparrow B\">\\(A\\uparrow B\\)</span>。这里用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_T,M_T,J_T\">\\(H_T,M_T,J_T\\)</span> 避免 Markdown 中上下箭头与度序混淆；三个定义逐项对应原式。所列公理序列有效，故所得公理集仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的 r.e. 扩张。</p>\n<p>这些是理论上的构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_T(M_T(A,B))\">\\(d_T(M_T(A,B))\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_T(J_T(A,B))\">\\(d_T(J_T(A,B))\\)</span> 分别为度的交、并，其代表元无关性和格结论由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" href=\"?note=4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-lattice\">67-thm-interpretability-lattice</a> 给出；不能直接把理论并集当成解释度的并。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-finite-subtheory","status":"resolved","id":"650dc4b8018183d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-finite-subtheory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"d404f437f90ff5f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathsf{Ext}(T),d_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-structure]]，$A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)$，并固定采用原始递归公理集代表。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-finite-subtheory","status":"resolved","id":"650dc4b8018183d7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\upharpoonright k$、$B\\upharpoonright k$ 是按固定编码界截取的有限子理论，见 [[67-df-finite-subtheory]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"d404f437f90ff5f6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}$ 为有限理论的一致性句，见 [[67-df-consistency-statement]]；有限公理集有标准有效证明检查式。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这些是理论上的构造。$d_T(M_T(A,B))$ 与 $d_T(J_T(A,B))$ 分别为度的交、并，其代表元无关性和格结论由 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]] 给出；不能直接把理论并集当成解释度的并。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,\\mathsf{Ext}(T),d_T","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\upharpoonright k","display":false},{"tex":"B\\upharpoonright k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"H_T,M_T,J_T","display":false},{"tex":"H_T(A)\\coloneqq T+\\{\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"M_T(A,B)\\coloneqq T+\\{\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}\\lor\\mathrm{Con}_{B\\upharpoonright k}:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"J_T(A,B)\\coloneqq T+\\{\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{B\\upharpoonright k}:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"A^T","display":false},{"tex":"A\\downarrow B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\uparrow B","display":false},{"tex":"H_T,M_T,J_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"d_T(M_T(A,B))","display":false},{"tex":"d_T(J_T(A,B))","display":false}],"bytes":2341,"backlinks":[{"id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Inf}_T,\\mathrm{Sup}_T$ 取 [[67-df-degree-bounds]]；$M_T,J_T$ 取 [[67-df-degree-theory-operations]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-theory-operations]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-theory-operations]]"}],"outgoing":["f5b9611e728efd8b","650dc4b8018183d7","d404f437f90ff5f6","4ff6c9f71377d6d7"]}